# Forever Protection Paladin (provisional: no in-game check yet; the seals, Holy Shield's charges and Judgement's
# effect on the seal are modelled from our casts and the blocks on us): Righteous Fury before combat, Judgement and
# Swift Judgement, Seal of Fury kept up and Holy Shield on cooldown at tier 2, Consecration, Holy Shock on Consecrated
# Ground, Holy Strike, Exorcism (after wowsims/forever's Protection APL, reference only).

actions.precombat=righteous_fury,if=!buff.righteous_fury.up
actions.precombat+=/retribution_aura,if=!buff.retribution_aura.up
actions.precombat+=/seal_of_fury,if=!buff.seal_of_fury.up
actions=judgement,use_off_gcd=1
actions+=/swift_judgement,use_off_gcd=1
actions+=/seal_of_fury,focus=2,if=!buff.seal_of_fury.up
actions+=/consecration
actions+=/holy_shock,if=debuff.consecrated_ground.up
actions+=/holy_shield,focus=2
actions+=/holy_strike
actions+=/exorcism
